NOTICE ON BUNDLED ASSETS

The MIT grant above covers the source code in this package only.

The files under assets/ are Mojang assets extracted from the vanilla Minecraft
Java Edition 1.21.4 client:

  assets/idle1.ogg, assets/idle2.ogg
      -> assets/minecraft/sounds/mob/villager/idle1.ogg, idle2.ogg
  assets/villager-face.png
      -> head-front region of assets/minecraft/textures/entity/villager/villager.png

They are the property of Mojang Studios / Microsoft, are not licensed under the
MIT terms above, and are included for local personal use. Redistributing them
commercially, or publishing a fork that bundles them, is not permitted by this
license. Replace them with your own audio and artwork before doing so.
